          <h4 style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1e3a8a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Microarchitectural Deep-Dive:</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155; margin: 0;">Ara implements element-wise vector chaining through fine-grained hazard scoreboards. A dependent vector instruction (e.g. <code>vadd.vv</code>) begins executing as soon as the first element slice of its source operand retires from the FPU pipeline, without waiting for the full 4096-bit register to finish. Each lane features an internal crossbar routing operands between the 8 local SRAM banks and the FPU, ALU, and Permute units.</p>
