          <h4 style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1e3a8a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Microarchitectural Deep-Dive:</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155; margin: 0;">AraXL replaces Ara's monolithic crossbar with a two-tier hierarchical routing network. Intra-cluster vector operations (e.g. <code>vfmacc.vv</code>) execute entirely within local cluster banks with zero inter-cluster wire delay. Inter-cluster operations (e.g. <code>vslideup</code>, <code>vfredsum</code>) traverse a pipelined cluster bridge, cutting critical path wire length by 45%.</p>
