          <h4 style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1e3a8a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Microarchitectural Deep-Dive:</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155; margin: 0;">Gemmini's double-buffered scratchpad allows simultaneous DMA memory bursts and systolic compute execution. While the systolic mesh computes matrix tile K, the autonomous DMA engine streams tile K+1 from L2 cache into the shadow scratchpad banks. Once computation finishes, pointers swap in a single clock cycle.</p>
