        <h3 class="dossier-title">Vortex &bull; Many-Core SIMT RISC-V GPGPU Coprocessor</h3>
        <span class="dossier-sub">Georgia Tech &bull; Apache-2.0 &bull; SystemVerilog / C++</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Stack -->
      <div class="dossier-specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">ISA:</span><span class="s-v"><code>RV32IMF-SIMT (OpenCL 1.2 Compliant)</code></span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Lanes:</span><span class="s-v">16 Lanes per Core (64 Threads Concurrent)</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Vector Length:</span><span class="s-v">64 Hardware Threads per Cluster</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">VRF Architecture:</span><span class="s-v">64-Thread GPR File + 16 KiB Shared Memory</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Host / Bus Interface:</span><span class="s-v">AXI4 Clustered Interconnect</span></div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="s-k">Silicon Footprint:</span><span class="s-v"><strong>~1,650 kGE per Core Cluster</strong></span></div>
