        <!-- Pros & Cons -->
        <div class="dossier-pros-cons">
          <div class="pros-box">
            <strong>Key Strengths:</strong>
            <ul><li>Full OpenCL 1.2 and SIMT software stack with compiler and runtime.</li><li>Hardware branch divergence stack handles complex conditional control flow.</li><li>Demonstrated on FPGA (Stratix 10, Alveo U280) and ASIC nodes.</li></ul>
